Id: squid005i
Severity: INFO
Category: services
Check: check_squid
Fix: Set httpd_suppress_version_string on in squid.conf.
References: squid.conf.documented
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST CM-6; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

Squid advertises its version in error pages and headers:
httpd_suppress_version_string is not on. That is the first thing an
attacker asks; set it on.
